#.  It is intentional that these functions do not set errno for this case
#.  see https://www.sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=6785
#. type: Plain text
#. #-#-#-#-#  fedora-rawhide: erfc.3.pot (PACKAGE VERSION)  #-#-#-#-#
#.  It is intentional that these functions do not set errno for this case
#.  see https://www.sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=6785
#. type: Plain text
